    {
      "id": "claim_c2948295bb3d427296ed47fc74705bb4",
      "statement": "A restore selects the newest epoch prefix containing LTX data and reads the full contiguous chain from transaction zero; no epoch seal object limits the chain, and a fenced node's unacknowledged tail may be exposed without violating the contract.",
