    {
      "id": "claim_d55e9694a37841c1bd4c4cb0738a089f",
      "statement": "The input gate implements blockConcurrencyWhile: while the gate is held, no incoming event of any kind is delivered to the cell except the event holding it, and in celld every storage path is local SQLite so a read or write completes inside its turn and never yields.",
